The SDL2 renderer (draw13) on the RG DS's two stacked panels (one 1024x1536 window, SDL_BANANA_PANELS=stack):
- a texture only cropped by the view is copied whole on the plain path and cropped by the GPU, not by the
  per-pixel cropping copy (half the speed on a Cortex-A55);
- BANANA_TARGET_HEIGHT: the view drawn into the window's top rows only (a one-screen game on the top panel);
- SIGUSR2 swaps the window's top and bottom halves (the RG DS's L2, through gw-hotkeys).

